### status: illustrative-only,recommended
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: false
### destructive: false
### requiresTenantHeaders: false
### llmOperational: false
### protectedContract: false
### referenceOnly: true
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: reference-only-nominal-payroll-option-source
### note: Demonstrates x-ui.optionSource.dependsOn with dependencyFilterMap.
### note: Angular reads the UI field universo and sends universoContexto to the option-source endpoint.
### note: Requires the quickstart version that publishes payrollProfile dependencyFilterMap.
### note: Requires an authenticated session whose principal has HR_ANALYTICS_NOMINAL_READ and a server-resolved department scope.

@baseUrl = https://praxis-api-quickstart.onrender.com
@sessionCookie = replace-with-session-cookie-value

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/human-resources/vw-analytics-folha-pagamento/option-sources/payrollProfile/options/filter?page=0&size=5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{sessionCookie}}

